28\" data-w=\"0.7\" data-r=\"0\" data-z=\"20\" data-fs=\"0.17\"><div class=\"escrito\" style=\"font-family:'Great Vibes',cursive;color:#8a2a2e;text-align:center;line-height:1.05\">My love</div></div><div data-retraso=\"2.4\" class=\"libre texto\" data-tipo=\"texto\" data-x=\"0.17\" data-y=\"0.58\" data-w=\"0.66\" data-r=\"0\" data-z=\"21\" data-fs=\"0.045\"><div class=\"escrito\" style=\"font-family:'Courier Prime',monospace;color:#3a2b27;text-align:center;line-height:1.5\">Some days I can't find the words, so today I'm writing them to you slowly. Thank you for your calm, for your laughter and for turning any place into a home. Everything is lovelier with you, even Mondays.</div></div><div data-retraso=\"3.8\" class=\"libre texto\" data-tipo=\"texto\" data-x=\"0.15\" data-y=\"1.03\" data-w=\"0.7\" data-r=\"0\" data-z=\"22\" data-fs=\"0.03\"><div class=\"escrito\" style=\"font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:600;color:#8a6a5a;text-align:center\">WITH ALL MY HEART</div></div><div data-ef=\"camino\" data-retraso=\"4.5\" data-camino=\"0.35,0;0.12,0;0,0\" class=\"libre texto\" data-tipo=\"texto\" data-x=\"0.2\" data-y=\"1.09\" data-w=\"0.6\" data-r=\"-3\" data-z=\"23\" data-fs=\"0.11\"><div class=\"escrito\" style=\"font-family:'Great Vibes',cursive;color:#8a2a2e;text-align:center;line-height:1.05\">Always</div></div>"}